          `crops = [[0, 0], [0, 0]]`:

      ```
      [[[[1]]], [[[2]]], [[[3]]], [[[4]]]]
      ```

      The output tensor has shape `[1, 2, 2, 1]` and value:

      ```
      x = [[[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]]]
      ```

