            batch / prod(block_shape),
            input_shape[1], ..., input_shape[N-1]]

      2. Permute dimensions of `reshaped` to produce `permuted` of shape
           [batch / prod(block_shape),

            input_shape[1], block_shape[0],
            ...,
            input_shape[M], block_shape[M-1],

            input_shape[M+1], ..., input_shape[N-1]]

